  "content_id": "16136184",
  "title": "MoonPay Transaction Issues",
  "description": " \nWhy Was My MoonPay Transaction Declined?\nIf your MoonPay transaction was declined, it’s usually due to card issues, verification problem...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My MoonPay Transaction Declined?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your MoonPay transaction was declined, it’s usually due to card issues, verification problems, or security filters. Here’s a quick overview of what might’ve gone wrong and how to fix it:</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Card Issues:</b> Insufficient funds, incorrect details, or card not 3D Secure-enabled</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> ID or payment method not fully verified</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Bank Restrictions:</b> Some banks block crypto transactions or flag them as risky</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Purchase Limits:</b> You may have hit daily or weekly transaction limits</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Flag:</b> Suspicious activity may trigger an automatic block</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Try a different card or payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete all verification steps</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank to approve the payment</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check your email (including spam) for MoonPay updates</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.moonpay.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"> <b>Contact MoonPay Support</b></a><b>:</b><a href=\"https://support.moonpay.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"> https://support.moonpay.com/</a></p></li></ol>",
